{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Medium Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"My Foster writes: This sweet, smiley boy is a professional cuddler who loves nothing more than curling up beside his person, belly up, ready for pets and scratches. Give him a little attention and he'll happily nudge himself against you for more. He's also an expert napper: with a few good belly rubs, PB can fall asleep almost instantly, often accompanied by the cutest little snores. With his big smile, affectionate personality, and love of cozy cuddle time, Peanut Buttercup is ready to be someone's very special best friend!\n\nWhat my friends at ACC say about me:\n\nMy history is a mystery and my friends here do not know much about me yet!\n\nIt is unknown if I have ever lived with other animals or children.\n\nI have medical needs that staff will address with you when you meet me.\n\nI am playful and cute!\n\nI will need daily physical activity to keep me healthy and happy!","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=17&searchType=4&animalid=207128","id":"613eddf0e83d0ad3ff9d25b7322451c6","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/9e8058b58459497995ce9237d41a3864-1788531589-1788531610-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/3a5e076d3a054e8d95ef209b2570243d-1788531589-1788531589-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/1a53268530e34e88837480a15af6e11e-1788531589-1788531589-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e48b7002be274cb28c73527f8a910c83-1788531589-1788531589-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5e0cd155df0241fc8b4eacd86daff614-1789329372-1789329372-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/755dfca3dbc544199bef8527